---
takeaways
+ have
  ```text
  第一、第二人称用 have, 如 i have、you have、we have.
  ```

+ has
  ```text
  第三人称用 has, 如 he has、she has.
  ```

+ A instead of B, A 代替了 B
  ```text
  Banana instead of Apple.
  Phone instead of Computer.
  ```
+ .... than i imagined, 比我想象更什么
  ```text
  tougher than i imagined.   # 比我想象更难
  stronger than i imagined.  # 比我想象更强壮
  easier than i imagined.    # 比我想象更简单
  longer than i imagined.    # 比我想象更长
  shorter than i imagined.   # 比我想象更短
  faster than i imagined.    # 比我想象更快
  safer than i imagined.     # 比我想象更安全
  ```
+ the difference between A and B, A 和 B 的区别
  ```text
  the difference between Banana and Apple.
  the difference between Phone and Computer.
  ```
+ even thouth, 尽管....、虽然....、但是.....
  ```text
  # 表示让步关系，也就是 "A 是事实，但 B 还是发生 或 虽然 A 但是 B"。
  # Even though 后面必须接"完整句子"，不能接"短语"。
  Even thouth was raining, I still went out.   
  I still went out even though it was raining.  
  ```
+ .... is tough, 做....很困难
  ```text
  cleaning the room is tough.
  drawing a picture is tough.
  learning English is tough.
  ```
+ with, 和......一起、用......做什么事情(强调做某事时用的是什么工具)
  ```text
  I go to the park with my friends.
  I clean the desk with a brush.
  ```
+ use, 使用......做什么事情(强调使用什么工具做某事)
  ```text
  I use a brush to clean the desk.
  ```
+ the A of the B, B 的 A 
  ```text
  the color of the car.     # 汽车的颜色
  the name of the person.   # 那个人的名字
  the price of the phone.   # 手机的价格
  the door of the room is very big  # 那个房间的门很大

  ```